<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso opens at 27.50 to the dlr.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso opens at 27.50 to the dlr.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine peso opened at 27.50 pesos to the dollar on Monday, lower than the level the market had expected it to trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>The peso was effectively devalued on Friday after the Central Bank said it would allow the peso to move in a new, wider range.</p>
<p>It had touched 29.45 per dollar, a drop of 11.5 percent, early on Friday before trading was suspended.</p>
